Here is the diagram.

28
00:02:28.099 --> 00:02:30.061
The broker: does not match orders.

29
00:02:30.341 --> 00:02:47.600
The exchange does (Ch 55). checks every order against the client's funds, holdings and risk limits before sending it (pre-trade RMS). streams market data. tracks positions and money. settles obligations with the clearing corporation and depositories.

