Onboarding and KYC:

34
00:02:55.510 --> 00:03:01.569
Identity, address, PAN, bank verification, e-sign, demat account opening, risk profiling.

35
00:03:01.849 --> 00:03:02.894
Funds service:

36
00:03:03.174 --> 00:03:07.526
Pay-in (UPI, net banking), payout requests, ledger of client money.

37
00:03:07.806 --> 00:03:08.638
OMS:

38
00:03:08.918 --> 00:03:14.827
