40
00:03:16.305 --> 00:03:22.150
Pre-trade checks: margin, holdings, limits, price bands; real-time risk; auto square-off.

41
00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:23.710
Exchange gateways:

42
00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:30.134
Connections to exchanges' trading systems per segment (equity, F and O, currency, commodity).

43
00:03:31.484 --> 00:03:32.444
Ticker plant:

44
00:03:32.724 --> 00:03:38.228
Receives exchange market data, normalises it, fans it out to clients over WebSockets.

45
00:03:38.508 --> 00:03:40.001
Positions and P and L:

46
00:03:40.281 --> 00:03:44.911
Real-time positions, M2M (mark-to-market), holdings valuation.

47
00:03:45.191 --> 00:03:46.705
GTT or alerts:

48
00:03:46.985 --> 00:03:49.396
Good-till-triggered orders and price alerts.

49
00:03:49.676 --> 00:03:50.700
Back office:

50
