Holdings, pledges for margin, delivery instructions (for example, authorisation for selling holdings).

53
00:04:06.561 --> 00:04:08.375
Mutual funds and IPO:

54
00:04:08.655 --> 00:04:15.311
Orders via exchange MF platforms or RTAs; IPO applications with UPI mandates.

55
00:04:16.661 --> 00:04:17.962
Trading APIs:

56
00:04:18.242 --> 00:04:22.466
Programmatic access for clients and third-party apps, with rate limits.

57
